# Build output
build/bin
# A stray "go build ./..." in the project root drops the exe right here.
NVENCForgeGUI.exe

# The three files the window writes for itself: the remembered size and place,
# what was saved so far, and the profiles. They live in tools/ (ignored below);
# the names stay listed here because an older copy may still have them lying
# next to the exe, and because the program falls back to that spot if the
# tools folder cannot be created.
NVENCForgeGUI.window
NVENCForgeGUI.savings
NVENCForgeGUI.profiles

# The bundled converter and its data. It is downloaded or built, never checked in:
# NVENCForge.exe, ffmpeg.exe, its INI and the sources it unpacks for itself.
tools/

node_modules

# Local safety copies made before edits.
_backup/

# Working memory of the assistant — never part of the public repo.
_claude_memory/
